    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62074" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαυκᾰνίη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνετο δ᾽ ᾗ κληῗδες ἀπ᾽ ὤμων
					αὐχέν᾽ ἔχουσι, λαυκανίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.325
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <i><span class="en">
				24.642
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκανίη</span></b>  is
				v.l. ibid. (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				48
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				68
			</span></i>) and prevails in later 
				Ep.
			, as <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				554
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκανίηθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.755
				</span></i>
			; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηνδε</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.192
			</span></i>).</div>
